  "bodyHash": "f59273ce6c7bed6a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>必要依賴項：</strong></span></p>\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight by maninthe_home</a></strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles by reascer</a></strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lendercataclysm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">L_Ender's Cataclysm by mcl_ender</a></strong></em></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-invincible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight - Invincible by P1nero</strong></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>選配：（用於自訂首領）</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Combat Evolution by ShelMarow</strong></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>2025年9月14日 - 今日加入我們的 Discord：</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1216528/description_835af751-2987-4c0a-a13b-6fb398df43b0.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"186\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/P8U47tyBYWQ?si=nnFO_Ur-s2YhElH8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>6 套全新無敵招式組：三重拳套（守衛、堡壘、大漩渦）、WASW、VASW 與布隆特斯（EX）｜新首領：Zertar｜新道具：生命汲取戒指與雙刃巨劍（Zweiender）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ydPLajT2vGU?si=t_LmWTSAQb6sxdS-\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新增自訂首領：MechX-12</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/6dIAIDafJmI?si=A5u_X9a1uwtu1nl1\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特殊招式組包含：地獄熔爐、虛空熔爐、焚化爐</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zM5ez46-WpA?si=aB0hijPgl7r79qyo\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>特殊招式組包含：毀滅者、靈魂渲染、瓶中沙暴、焚化爐 + 烈焰堡壘、焚身者</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/fhJFdI1S73E?si=JCtqt_t9M-cYGLJF\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>已收錄特殊招式組：雷霆之怒、潮汐利爪（單手與雙手皆備）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>歡迎來到《災厄武裝：重製版》</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>《災厄武裝：重製版》</strong>前身為<strong>《災厄武裝：渲染藝術》</strong>，這是其擴展版本，帶來更多戰鬥！更多技能！以及更史詩的體驗！<br>- 提供模組版本以便更方便下載，若您偏好數據包，請前往原版<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-cataclysm-l_enders-cataclysm-weapons-of\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">災厄武裝</a>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>- 事實上：《災厄武裝》中的一些自訂招式組讓我深感興趣，因此我將其視為一份禮物！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong>請大家耐心等待，更多特殊的 EFI 招式組即將推出……</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>玩家創作展示：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>笑聲獵人的追獵：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n2j5t6HZjto?si=0mM6n0TfvZxX6hOY\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XU1f9VIJkK8?si=B0qFiNoZk7I2pVPO\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S5JNIYR7gTk?si=yPg5HN9Jx5anbQHX\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OFHyr_lmlCQ?si=N4FoIlt2gIGpYSgj\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>將此技巧在空中發揮到極致的頂尖高手&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>W</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-OoN1E2T9ik?si=X9c-saIYRzErWqEF\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hvfIRKZm2WY?si=zb2nqCmW4v4Uaaud\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">&nbsp;<strong>目前內容清單：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*V1.1.0：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*無敵招式組：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- 焚化爐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- 地獄熔爐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>-&nbsp;</strong>虛空熔爐</span></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*V1.2.0：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*無敵招式組：</span></p>\n<p>- 毀滅者 + 靈魂渲染</p>\n<p>- 瓶中沙暴（雙手）<br>- 焚身者（雙手）</p>\n<p>- 焚化爐 + 烈焰堡壘</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*自訂內容：</span></p>\n<p>- <strong>熾焰穿透者</strong> - <strong>（技能書 - 災厄藝術）</strong> | 一種由 Ignis 使用的突刺技能，將敵人固定在刀鋒上快速造成傷害，有 75% 機率從 Ignis 掉落</p>\n<p><strong>- 詛咒擒拿&nbsp;</strong>- <strong>（技能書 - 災厄藝術）</strong> | 一種由 Maledictus 使用的抓取技能，將敵人帶至空中後墜落，引發鬼火爆炸，有 75% 機率從 Maledictus 掉落</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>*V1.3.0：</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*無敵招式組：</span><br>- 雷霆之怒</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">- 潮汐利爪（單手與雙手皆備）</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>*V1.4.0：</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*自訂內容：</span></p>\n<p><strong>- 新增首領：</strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">MechX-12&nbsp;</span>及其對應結構</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>*V1.5.0：</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*自訂內容：</span></p>\n<p><strong>- 新增首領：</strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Zertar</span> </span>及其對應結構<br><strong>- 新增道具：</strong>生命汲取戒指、雙刃巨劍（Zweiender）<br><strong>- 新增 2 本技能書：<br></strong><strong>+ 技術機械&nbsp;</strong>（從 MechX-12 掉落率 90%）：移動系，賦予您滑行、震地摔等能力<br><strong>+ 破碎深淵&nbsp;</strong>（從海妖 Leviathan 掉落率 75%）：災厄藝術系，召喚空間裂縫<br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">*無敵招式組：</span></span><br><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">- 守衛拳套（單手與雙手）<br></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">- 堡壘拳套（單手與雙手）<br><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">- 大漩渦拳套（雙手）<br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">- WASW（單手與雙手）<br></span></span><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">- VASW（單手與雙手）</span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">授權條款：保留所有權利（+ 自訂規定）</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">本人保留此模組的所有權利。請嚴格遵守以下使用規範。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">允許：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">進行影片展示或撰寫評論</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">可為此模組製作資源包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">可在您遊玩或創作的整合包中使用此模組</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">禁止：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">禁止修改核心程式碼或重新上傳</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">禁止移植至其他版本並重新發布（若您需移植，仍須先取得<strong>本人許可</strong>）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">禁止將本模組設為「必要依賴項」以用於您的模組</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a;text-decoration:underline\"><strong>致謝名單：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>breadbright</strong> (truncatemol) - 我的朋友，提供了許多靈感並繪製了精美的貼圖</p>\n<p><strong>TheMemeSmeller</strong> (JustARandomGuy) - 《<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/weapons-of-cataclysm-l_enders-cataclysm-weapons-of\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">災厄武裝</a></strong>（數據包）的原作者，也與我合作為我的模組製作了相容性數據包，同時感謝他允許我在本模組頁面展示他的作品</p>\n<p><strong>maninthe_home | reascer | mcl_ender | P1nero </strong>- <strong>EpicFight</strong>&nbsp;| <strong>Weapons Of Miracles</strong> | <strong>L_Ender's Cataclysm | EF-Invincible</strong>&nbsp;模組的開發者，感謝你們製作出這些極佳的模組</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
